      "n": 66,
      "evidence": "Re-simulating your declared rule with stops checked on 1-minute closes and filled at the level reproduces 100.0 % of your declared returns to 1e-6. (Exit at the close: 61.3 %; resting stop: 72.9 %.) That convention cannot be executed: a resting stop fires on intrabar wicks, and a rule that only looks at closes can only exit at the close.",
