      "impact": "If your stop is a resting order, these trades should have been stopped earlier."
    },
    {
      "code": "H1",
      "category": "hint",
      "title": "Entries stamped at a bar's open time but filled at its close",
      "n": 236,
      "evidence": "The entry price equals the close of the bar whose open time is the entry time. If the signal uses that close, the backtest enters at the very price that created the signal.",
